# Bbox cache rebuilt by `pnpm manifest` — keyed by mtime,
# committing it just churns. Generated catalog JSON under src/lib and
# public/ (including the per-pack files in public/media-catalog/packs/)
# is checked in: CI and fresh checkouts do not have assets/, so the
# committed catalogs are what the deployed bundle ships with.
.manifest-bbox-cache.json

